  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HydroNeo - a company that offers a Smart Farm System designed to address inefficiencies within the shrimp farming industry, such as production failure and high operational cost. HydroNeo integrates smart technology, such as farm monitoring automation, weather warning and disease detection, resulting in energy savings, improved profitability and productivity for farmers.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GSMA funding will be utilized to create and promote the &quot;HydroNeo Digital Farm App,&quot; accessible to all shrimp farmers and helping mitigate climate-change-induced risks.

The HydroNeo Digital Farm App will feature six main functionalities, including (1) regional climate and weather data, (2) disease warning and reporting, (3) smartphone-based shrimp measurement, growth analytics, and disease detection, (4) domestic shrimp market price index with trends and predictions, (5) financial performance overview for farmers, and (6) market demand overview from processors.</narrative>
  </description>
